---
import {isCoastalEdition} from '../data/edition';
import Shell from '../layouts/Shell.astro';
import preparation from '../../../../kb/research/journey-checklist.json';
import {journeyCatalog} from '../data/journey-catalog';
---
<Shell title="My Odisha Journey" active="journey" wide>
<div class="wrap journey-page" id="journey-app">
 <header class="journey-intro"><p class="eyebrow">A place. A taste. A story to take with you.</p><h1>My Odisha <em>Journey.</em></h1><p class="lead">Collect what draws you here. Make room for a slow morning, a good meal, a story you want to follow.</p><p class="journey-privacy">Saved only in this browser. Export a backup to keep or move your plan. Clearing browser data removes the saved copy.</p><p><a class="text-link" href="/journey-starters/">Need a starting point? Browse journey starters →</a></p></header>
 <noscript><p class="notice">Enable JavaScript to save, arrange and print your journey. You can still explore the links below.</p></noscript>
 <p id="journey-status" role="status" aria-live="polite"></p>
 <div class="journey-recovery" id="journey-recovery" hidden><p>Your saved data needs attention. Export it before starting again.</p><button id="download-existing" type="button" class="utk-button utk-button--secondary">Download existing data</button><button id="start-new" type="button" class="utk-button utk-button--secondary">Start a new journey</button></div>
 <section class="journey-tools" aria-label="Journey details"><div class="journey-basics"><label class="utk-field">Selected journey<select id="trip-select" disabled></select></label><label class="utk-field">Your journey’s name<input id="journey-title" maxlength="120" value="My Odisha Journey" disabled/></label><label class="trip-date utk-field"><span data-journey-guidance="date">First travel day (optional)</span><input id="journey-date" type="date" min="1900-01-01" max="9998-12-31" disabled/></label></div><p class="journey-help">Start with ideas. Add dates when you’re ready.</p>
 <details class="journey-management"><summary>Manage journeys & backups</summary><div class="trip-manager"><div><label class="utk-field">New journey name<input id="new-trip-name" maxlength="120" placeholder="A coastal weekend" disabled/></label><div class="actions"><button id="create-trip" disabled class="utk-button utk-button--secondary">Create journey</button><button id="duplicate-trip" disabled class="utk-button utk-button--secondary">Duplicate selected journey</button><button id="delete-trip" disabled class="utk-button utk-button--secondary">Delete selected journey</button></div></div><div><p>Keep an editable copy or bring back a saved plan.</p><div class="actions"><button id="export-journey" class="utk-button utk-button--secondary" disabled>Export selected journey</button><button id="export-all" disabled class="utk-button utk-button--secondary">Back up all journeys</button><label class="import-label" for="import-journey">Import backup<input id="import-journey" type="file" accept=".json,application/json" disabled/></label></div><div id="import-preview" hidden><h3 id="import-preview-heading" tabindex="-1">Review your backup</h3><p id="import-limit" hidden>You already have ten journeys. You can add new ideas to the selected journey, or export and remove a journey before importing another.</p><p id="import-description"></p><label id="import-source-field" hidden>Journey from this backup<select id="import-source"></select></label><p id="merge-description"></p><button id="merge-import" class="utk-button utk-button--secondary" type="button">Add new ideas to selected journey</button><button id="confirm-import" class="utk-button utk-button--secondary">Import journey</button><details id="replace-collection-options" hidden><summary>Replace the entire collection instead</summary><p>This removes the saved collection in this browser and uses every journey in the backup. Export your current collection first.</p><label><input id="replace-ack" type="checkbox"/> I want to replace all saved journeys</label><button id="replace-library" type="button" disabled>Replace all journeys</button></details><button id="cancel-import" class="utk-button utk-button--secondary">Cancel</button></div></div></div></details></section>
 <nav class="journey-stage-nav" aria-label="Plan your journey"><a href="#plan-heading">1 · Arrange your ideas</a><a href="#preparation" data-journey-guidance="preparationNav">2 · Before you go</a><a href="#take-journey">3 · Take it with you</a></nav>
 <div class="journey-layout"><section class="journey-plan" aria-labelledby="plan-heading"><p class="eyebrow">Make it yours</p><h2 id="plan-heading">Make this journey yours.</h2><p class="journey-help" data-journey-guidance="plan">Give each idea a day, or leave it for later. Move items within a day with ↑ and ↓. These are your choices, not a checked route or a booking.</p><section class="journey-coach" aria-labelledby="journey-coach-heading"><h3 id="journey-coach-heading">One day at a time.</h3><p id="journey-coach-copy">Choose an anchor, make room for travel and a pause, then collect the questions you still need to ask.</p><div class="actions"><a id="journey-coach-next" class="text-link" href="/journey-starters/#find-your-trail">Find a starting point →</a><button id="add-planning-day" type="button" disabled>Add a day</button></div><p class="day-note-help" data-journey-guidance="outline">The day notebook offers an optional outline for a main experience, travel, a meal, a pause and things still to confirm.</p></section><section id="journey-overview" aria-label="Journey overview"></section><button id="undo-removal" class="utk-button utk-button--secondary" type="button" hidden>Undo last removal</button><details class="day-tools utk-disclosure"><summary>Arrange whole days</summary><p>Add a quiet day, move a day’s ideas together, or shift planned days. These tools do not calculate travel time or change your trip’s start date.</p><div class="shift-tools"><label>Shift planned days by<input id="shift-days" type="number" min="-29" max="29" step="1" value="1" disabled aria-describedby="shift-days-help"/></label><button id="apply-day-shift" type="button" disabled>Shift planned days</button></div><p id="shift-days-help" class="journey-help">Use a positive number for later days or a negative number for earlier days. Ideas for later stay there. Day titles and notes move with their day.</p><button id="undo-day-change" type="button" hidden>Undo last day arrangement</button></details><div class="saved-filter"><label class="utk-field">Find in your saved ideas<input id="saved-search" type="search" maxlength="200" placeholder="Search titles or your notes"/></label><button id="saved-clear" type="button" hidden>Clear saved search</button><p id="saved-filter-status" role="status"></p></div><div id="journey-items"></div><div id="journey-empty"><h3>Every journey starts with curiosity.</h3><p>Add something from the collection, or <a href="/explore/">explore Odisha</a> and save as you go.</p></div></section>
 <aside class="journey-discover" aria-labelledby="ideas-heading"><p class="eyebrow">A little inspiration</p><h2 id="ideas-heading">What calls to you?</h2><label class="utk-field">Find an idea<input id="journey-search" type="search" placeholder={isCoastalEdition?'Try Konark, Puri or food':'Try birds, Konark or food'} maxlength="200"/></label><label class="utk-field">Type of idea<select id="journey-kind"><option value="">All types</option>{["Place","Experience","Food","Stay area","Reading"].filter(kind=>journeyCatalog.some(item=>item.kind===kind)).map(kind=><option>{kind}</option>)}</select></label><p id="idea-count" role="status"></p><div class="journey-ideas">{journeyCatalog.map(item=><article data-journey-idea data-kind={item.kind} data-search={[item.title,item.kind,item.area,...(item.aliases||[])].join(' ')}><p class="eyebrow">{item.kind} · {item.area}</p><h3><a href={item.href}>{item.title}</a></h3><p>{item.summary}</p><button data-save-journey={item.id} type="button" disabled class="utk-button utk-button--secondary">Save to my journey +</button><span data-save-status role="status"></span></article>)}</div><button id="more-ideas" type="button" hidden class="utk-button utk-button--secondary">Show more ideas</button></aside></div>
 <section class="preparation" id="preparation"><div class="preparation-heading"><p class="eyebrow">Leave with a little less to wonder about</p><h2 data-journey-guidance="preparationTitle">Before you go</h2><p data-journey-guidance="preparationCopy">Collect the questions that matter to your trip. A tick records your own progress.</p><p id="ready-summary" role="status"></p></div><details class="utk-disclosure"><summary data-journey-guidance="checklist">Before you go · preparation checklist</summary><p>These are your own reminders for the selected journey. A tick means you marked it done; Project Odisha has not verified the arrangement.</p><fieldset><legend>Things I want to check</legend><div class="preparation-fields">{preparation.items.map(item=><label><input type="checkbox" data-preparation-id={item.id} disabled/><span>{item.label}</span></label>)}</div></fieldset><p id="preparation-count" role="status" aria-live="polite"></p><ul id="preparation-extra" hidden></ul><p class="journey-help">Included in your backups and offline book. Keep editing with the current website; older versions may not retain checklist marks.</p></details>
 <details class="utk-disclosure" id="personal-reminders"><summary>My personal reminders</summary><p id="reminder-privacy">Private to this browser and your backups. Turn off personal notes to leave reminder wording and ticks out of shared books. Up to 40 reminders, 500 characters each.</p><form id="add-reminder-form"><label>Something I want to remember<textarea id="new-reminder" maxlength="500" rows="2" required disabled aria-describedby="reminder-privacy" placeholder="Ask our host about the return pickup"></textarea></label><button id="add-reminder" type="submit" disabled>Add reminder</button></form><p id="reminder-count" role="status"></p><ul id="reminder-list"></ul><button id="undo-reminder" type="button" hidden>Undo removed reminder</button></details>
 <details class="utk-disclosure" id="suggested-questions"><summary>Questions for my saved places</summary><p>Pick the questions that will help your own visit. Adding one creates a personal reminder you can edit and tick.</p><div id="question-suggestions"></div></details></section>
 <section id="take-journey" class="journey-takeaway"><div><p class="eyebrow">Take the story with you</p><h2>A small book.<br/><em>Your own Odisha.</em></h2><p data-journey-guidance="takeaway">Carry your places, days, notes and preparation checklist. Choose a lightweight text edition or a book with photographs.</p></div><div><label class="utk-field">What to put in this book<select id="book-scope"><option value="all">Whole journey</option></select></label><p id="book-scope-help" class="journey-help">Your full saved plan stays unchanged. Preparation and personal reminders apply to the whole trip.</p><label class="book-notes-choice"><input id="include-personal-notes" type="checkbox" checked/><span>Include my personal notes in books and print</span></label><p class="journey-help">Turn this off for a copy to share. Item notes, day titles, day notes and personal reminders are private writing. Journey name, dates and saved choices remain in shared copies. Your saved notes and JSON backups stay complete.</p><p id="empty-download-help" class="journey-help">Save an idea, add a day or write a reminder to create a book.</p><div class="actions"><button id="offline-book" disabled class="utk-button utk-button--secondary">Download offline book</button><button id="illustrated-book" disabled class="button utk-button">Download with photos</button><button id="plain-itinerary" type="button" class="utk-button utk-button--secondary" disabled>Download text itinerary</button><button id="cancel-photo-book" type="button" class="utk-button utk-button--secondary" hidden>Cancel photo book</button><button id="print-journey" class="utk-button utk-button--secondary" disabled>Print / save PDF</button></div><p id="download-feedback" role="status" aria-live="polite" class="journey-help"></p><p id="print-feedback" role="status" aria-live="polite"></p><p class="journey-help">The book opens offline in a browser; external links need the internet. The photo edition embeds up to 12 credited photographs, within an 8 MB image budget. Use the note-sharing choice above. Keep a JSON backup to edit the plan later.</p><p class="journey-help">If printing is unavailable here, download the book and open it in a browser with Print support.</p></div></section>
 <p class="journey-caution">Stay areas are starting points for accommodation research. Confirm transport, access, opening times and food or stay availability before setting out. No route times or bookings are provided.</p>
</div>
<article id="journey-print" aria-label="Printable tour book"></article>
</Shell>
<style is:global>
#download-feedback{overflow-wrap:anywhere}
.saved-filter{margin:24px 0}.saved-filter p,.note-count{font-size:13px}.note-count{display:block;font-weight:400;margin-top:6px}.journey-page .book-notes-choice{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:12px;min-height:48px;cursor:pointer}body.utk .journey-page .book-notes-choice input{width:22px;height:22px;min-height:22px;padding:0;margin:0;flex:0 0 22px;accent-color:var(--sea)}

.journey-basics{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 1.4fr 1fr;gap:24px;align-items:end}.journey-tools .journey-basics .trip-date{margin:0}.journey-management{margin-top:24px;border-top:1px solid var(--line);padding-top:14px}.journey-management summary{min-height:44px;padding:10px 0;color:var(--sea)}.journey-management .trip-manager{margin:16px 0 0;padding:16px 0 0;border:0}.journey-stage-nav{display:flex;gap:16px 32px;flex-wrap:wrap;border-block:1px solid var(--line);padding:14px 0;margin-bottom:32px}.journey-stage-nav a{min-height:44px;display:inline-flex;align-items:center;text-decoration:none;font-size:14px}.journey-stage-nav a:hover{text-decoration:underline}.journey-takeaway{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 1.2fr;gap:60px;padding:40px;background:var(--paper);margin-top:48px;scroll-margin-top:28px}.journey-takeaway h2{margin-block:16px 24px}.journey-takeaway>div>p{max-width:50ch}.journey-takeaway .journey-help{font-size:14px;margin-bottom:0}.journey-discover{border-left:1px solid var(--line);padding-left:36px}.journey-intro .lead{max-width:58ch}@media(max-width:850px){.journey-basics{grid-template-columns:1fr}.journey-takeaway{grid-template-columns:1fr;gap:28px;padding:24px}.journey-discover{border-left:0;padding:28px 0 0;border-top:1px solid var(--line)}}

#journey-overview{padding:20px;background:var(--paper);margin:24px 0}#journey-overview nav{display:flex;gap:12px;flex-wrap:wrap}.journey-group{scroll-margin-top:100px}.journey-area-note{padding:15px;border-left:3px solid var(--earth);background:var(--paper);font-size:14px}.journey-access{font-size:14px;color:var(--muted)}
.trip-manager{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr;gap:28px;padding-bottom:25px;margin-bottom:25px;border-bottom:1px solid var(--line)}.trip-date{margin-top:20px;max-width:330px}.journey-tools .journey-help{font-size:14px;margin-bottom:0}@media(max-width:850px){.trip-manager{grid-template-columns:1fr}}
.journey-page{padding-bottom:60px}.journey-intro{padding:55px 0 30px;max-width:1000px}.journey-intro h1{margin-bottom:24px}.journey-intro em{color:var(--earth)}.journey-privacy{font-size:14px;margin-top:22px;max-width:720px}.journey-tools{background:var(--paper);padding:28px;margin:20px 0 45px}.journey-page label{display:block;font-weight:600;font-size:14px}.journey-page input:not([type=file]):not([type=checkbox]),.journey-page textarea,.journey-page select{display:block;font:inherit;padding:12px;border:1px solid var(--muted);background:var(--light);color:var(--ink);max-width:100%;width:100%;margin-top:8px;border-radius:0}.journey-page textarea{resize:vertical;min-height:95px}.journey-tools>label{max-width:650px}.journey-page button{cursor:pointer;min-height:44px;padding:10px 14px;border:1px solid var(--sea);background:var(--light);color:var(--sea)}.journey-page button.button{background:var(--sea);color:var(--light)}.journey-page button:disabled{opacity:.55;cursor:default}.journey-page .actions{margin-top:18px;gap:14px}.import-label input{display:block;max-width:260px;margin-top:6px}.journey-layout{display:grid;grid-template-columns:minmax(0,1.35fr) minmax(0,1fr);gap:60px}.journey-help{margin:20px 0 30px;max-width:650px}.journey-item{border:1px solid var(--line);padding:24px;margin:20px 0;background:var(--paper)}.journey-item h3{font-size:29px;margin:12px 0}.journey-item p{margin:10px 0}.journey-item label{margin:18px 0}.journey-item-controls{display:flex;gap:10px;flex-wrap:wrap}.journey-group h3{margin-top:30px}.journey-ideas{display:grid;gap:20px;margin-top:20px}.journey-ideas article{border-bottom:1px solid var(--line);padding:22px 0}.journey-ideas article[hidden]{display:none}.journey-ideas h3{font-size:27px}.journey-ideas p{margin:14px 0}.journey-ideas span{display:block;font-size:13px}.journey-discover>label{margin-top:25px}#journey-empty{background:var(--paper);padding:35px;margin:25px 0}#journey-empty p{margin-top:20px}.journey-caution{margin-top:40px;font-size:14px;max-width:850px}#journey-status{color:var(--earth);font-weight:600}#import-preview,.journey-recovery{padding:22px;border:2px solid var(--earth);margin-top:20px}#import-preview button,.journey-recovery button{margin:10px 10px 0 0}#journey-print{display:none}
@media(max-width:850px){.journey-layout{grid-template-columns:1fr;gap:40px}.journey-tools{padding:22px}.journey-tools .actions{align-items:start;flex-direction:column}}
@media print{@page{size:auto;margin:18mm}body{background:white!important;color:#111!important;font:11pt/1.5 Georgia,serif}body>.topline,body>.header,body>.skip,body>.footer,#journey-app,.related-discoveries{display:none!important}#journey-print{display:block!important;max-width:none;margin:0}#journey-print h1{font-size:30pt;letter-spacing:0;overflow-wrap:anywhere}#journey-print h2{font-size:21pt;margin:22pt 0 12pt;break-after:avoid}#journey-print h3{overflow-wrap:anywhere;font-size:15pt;margin:14pt 0 8pt;break-after:avoid}#journey-print h4{break-after:avoid;margin:14pt 0 6pt}#journey-print section>div{break-inside:avoid}#journey-print .print-questions>p{break-after:avoid}#journey-print p{margin:8pt 0;white-space:pre-wrap;overflow-wrap:anywhere;orphans:3;widows:3}#journey-print a{overflow-wrap:anywhere;color:#111}#journey-print .print-notes{border-left:2pt solid #888;padding-left:12pt}#journey-print .print-sources{font-size:9pt;break-before:page}#journey-print li{margin:10pt 0;overflow-wrap:anywhere}main{margin:0;padding:0}}
.preparation{margin:32px 0;scroll-margin-top:24px}.preparation details{border-block:1px solid var(--line);padding:16px 0}.preparation summary{padding:12px 0;color:var(--sea);font-weight:600}.preparation details>p{margin:20px 0;max-width:75ch}.preparation fieldset{border:0;padding:0;margin:20px 0}.preparation legend{font-weight:600;margin-bottom:16px}.preparation-fields{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr;gap:12px 30px}.preparation-fields label{display:flex;align-items:flex-start;gap:12px;padding:12px;min-height:48px;background:var(--paper);cursor:pointer}body.utk .journey-page .preparation-fields input{width:22px;height:22px;min-height:22px;padding:0;flex-shrink:0;margin:2px 0;accent-color:var(--sea)}.preparation-fields span{min-width:0}.preparation-fields label:focus-within{outline:2px solid var(--earth);outline-offset:2px}@media(max-width:750px){.preparation-fields{grid-template-columns:1fr}}
</style>

<style is:global>
#download-feedback{overflow-wrap:anywhere}
.day-tools{border-block:1px solid var(--line);padding:12px 0;margin:24px 0}.day-tools summary,.day-notebook summary{min-height:48px;padding:12px 0;cursor:pointer;color:var(--sea);font-weight:600}.day-tools>p{margin:16px 0}.shift-tools{display:flex;gap:14px;align-items:end;flex-wrap:wrap;margin-top:20px}.shift-tools label{max-width:240px}.day-notebook{border-block:1px solid var(--line);margin:18px 0;padding:8px 0}.day-notebook label{margin:12px 0}.day-notebook input,.day-notebook textarea{max-width:100%}.day-note-help{font-size:13px;margin:12px 0}.day-move{display:flex;gap:12px;align-items:end;flex-wrap:wrap;margin:18px 0}.day-move label{max-width:100%;flex:1 1 180px}.day-move button{flex:0 1 auto}.day-empty{font:20px/1.7 var(--serif);color:var(--sea);margin:18px 0}.day-notebook .note-count{font-size:13px}
@media(max-width:600px){.shift-tools,.day-move{align-items:stretch;flex-direction:column}.day-move label{flex:auto}.shift-tools label{max-width:none}}
</style>

<style is:global>
#download-feedback{overflow-wrap:anywhere}
.preparation-heading{max-width:65ch;padding:20px 0}.preparation-heading h2{margin:16px 0}.preparation-heading p{margin:16px 0}#ready-summary{padding:16px 20px;border-left:3px solid var(--earth);background:var(--paper);font-size:15px}#personal-reminders form{max-width:680px}#personal-reminders form button{margin-top:14px}#reminder-list{list-style:none;padding:0;max-width:780px}#reminder-list>li{padding:20px 0;border-bottom:1px solid var(--line)}#reminder-list .reminder-check{display:flex;gap:12px;align-items:flex-start;line-height:1.8;overflow-wrap:anywhere}body.utk .journey-page .reminder-check input{width:22px;min-height:22px;height:22px;flex:0 0 22px;margin-top:2px;padding:0;accent-color:var(--sea)}.reminder-edit{margin:12px 0}.reminder-edit summary{font-size:14px}.reminder-edit textarea{margin:10px 0}.question-group{margin:24px 0}.question-group h3{font-size:26px}.question-group li{padding:12px 0;line-height:1.8}.question-group li p{margin:0 0 10px}.question-group li button{font-size:14px}.journey-takeaway #book-scope{margin-bottom:12px}#import-source-field{margin:16px 0}#replace-collection-options{margin:18px 0;padding:14px;border:1px solid var(--earth)}#replace-collection-options summary{min-height:44px}#replace-collection-options label{display:flex;gap:12px;align-items:center}body.utk #replace-ack{width:22px;height:22px;min-height:22px;flex:0 0 22px;margin:0}#import-preview p{overflow-wrap:anywhere}
</style>

<style is:global>
.journey-coach{padding:24px;border-left:3px solid var(--earth);background:var(--paper);margin:24px 0}.journey-coach h3{font-size:28px;margin:0 0 16px}.journey-coach p{margin:14px 0}.journey-day-cards{list-style:none;padding:0;margin:20px 0 0;display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(2,minmax(0,1fr));gap:14px}.journey-day-cards li{min-width:0;border:1px solid var(--line);padding:18px;background:var(--light);overflow-wrap:anywhere}.journey-day-cards a{display:block;min-height:44px;font-weight:600}.journey-day-cards p{margin:8px 0;font-size:14px}.journey-day-cards .day-card-title{font:21px/1.4 var(--serif);color:var(--sea)}.day-outline-actions{display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:12px;align-items:center;margin:16px 0}.day-outline-actions a{padding:12px 0}body.utk .journey-page .day-notebook textarea{min-height:300px}@media(max-width:600px){.journey-day-cards{grid-template-columns:1fr}.journey-coach{padding:20px}}
</style>
